WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:05.550
Chapter 25

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:05.550
What Must be Protected

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.930
Those Imperial bastards are insane.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.140
Don't be reckless, Emile!

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.450
Don't worry, brother!

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:39.190
This little bit of...

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:45.900
Emile!

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:48.190
Set up a smokescreen!

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:51.400
Take this!

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:58.600
Emile, hang in there!

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:01.660
We should move him! This place is...

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:03.130
Give me a hand.

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:04.500
O-Okay.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.800
Take him away immediately!

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.550
Hey!

00:01:21.550 --> 00:01:24.590
What's the progress on the spear's installation?

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:25.400
Sir!

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:27.670
It will be done soon!

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:31.440
When the work is finished, we'll be able to leave Randgriz.

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:34.790
It'll be troublesome if the Gallia soldiers manage to get in.

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:36.360
Hurry up and finish!

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:37.530
Yes sir!

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:40.620
By the way, where's 2nd Lieutenant Karl Oswald?

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:43.080
About that...

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:56.160
How are the rest of the squads doing?

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:58.100
I'm looking into it right now!

00:01:58.100 --> 00:01:59.470
Because of how sudden this was,

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:01.840
the rest of them are in a mess too.

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:04.120
I've finished the emergency treatment!

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:06.900
But he has lost too much blood...

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:08.560
Hang in there, Emile.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:12.420
Come on! Didn't we promise to go home together?

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:14.600
Don't worry!

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:16.010
He'll survive.

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:17.240
You're a guy!

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:19.230
Don't act so wimpy!

00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:20.950
Largo, you're injured...

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.210
I'm okay!

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:23.750
A scratch like this...

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:26.630
But they charged in with a dreadnought so suddenly...

00:02:26.630 --> 00:02:28.320
They trying to commit suicide? {kamikaze}

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:29.670
What's going on?

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:30.960
Everyone, listen in.

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:33.820
Try to drag the gunfight as long as possible!

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:34.850
Depending on the situation,

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:37.220
keep in mind that a more desperate battle may be approaching.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.180
But I thought we were going to save Alicia?

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:44.390
It's a pity, but we don't have time to save her.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.310
Commander!

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.150
Right before the enemy's terrestrial dreadnought hit,

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:54.310
there was a giant explosion in Ghirlandaio!

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:55.280
What?!

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:56.830
No way...

00:02:56.830 --> 00:02:58.490
Then Alicia...

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:01.220
Don't say something so ominous!

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:04.630
Concentrate on the fight at hand.

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:07.920
We need to open a path with our own hands!

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:10.190
If not,

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:12.380
we won't be able to face Alicia.

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:16.590
You're right.

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:18.050
Aisha, take care of Emile!

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.330
Okay!

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:23.360
All right, let's kick their asses until no one's left standing!

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:25.200
Let's do this, guys!

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.620
Yeah!

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:35.730
How's it going?

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:38.680
Everything is done.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:41.010
We can move out anytime.

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.400
Let's begin then.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.730
Hold on a second.

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:47.300
More importantly, I heard that Karl was shot.

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:48.170
Yes.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:50.420
It's because he opposed me.

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:51.950
I executed him.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.030
You were the one?

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.580
Yes.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:59.840
If you do the same, I won't be lenient.

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.140
Begin!

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:02.160
Yes, sir!

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:20.630
How thick is that armor?!

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:22.220
Don't give up!

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:25.280
Destroy their guns one by one.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:27.660
Make use of the smokescreens and get in close!

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:46.410
What?

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:47.810
They've started moving?

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:51.530
It's not because of our attacks, right?

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:52.960
Of course not.

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:56.570
We probably didn't even scratch that monster.

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:59.230
Why then?

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:00.660
They're planning to retreat.

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:02.110
Guys, retreat to point E! {Taihi = Retreat}

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:21.390
Wha...

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:22.930
What the hell is that?

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:27.390
That shape...

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:29.970
It's just like...

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.430
the Valkyria spear which Alicia used.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:36.810
So this is the holy spear of the Valkyrur?

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:38.820
That's right.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:45.280
No one would've guessed such an ancient relic was sealed inside the castle.

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:51.910
Marmota, this terrestrial dreadnought, was crafted to display the true power of...

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:53.950
the holy spear once again.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.010
True power?

00:05:56.010 --> 00:06:02.420
This holy relic is the legendary spear that the Valkyrur used during the Darcsen Calamity. {It's called the 'Darcsen Calamity' in game - Ryan}

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:04.790
The legendary Valkyrur...

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:09.180
used the true power of the holy spear to defeat the Darcsens,

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:11.270
and forcefully oppressed them.

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:12.750
Oppressed?

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:14.280
What do you mean?

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:16.680
The Valkyrur were saviors of the world, weren't they?

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:20.690
That's only because the Valkyrur rewrote history.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:25.030
This land, which was originally ruled by Darcsens,

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:28.910
was taken over by the invading Valkyria and their combat prowess.

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:35.110
For their own benefit, they altered the truth and passed them down as legends.

00:06:35.110 --> 00:06:39.630
History is written by the victor.{History exists for the victor}

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:42.250
This guy...

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:58.500
Prepare to fire the holy spear.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:06:59.910
Do a test shot.

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:02.160
Aim towards the hill at 8 o'clock.

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.060
Yes, sir!

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.190
I want to witness it with my own eyes.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:08.150
Preparing to fire.

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:10.150
Turning towards 8 o'clock.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:12.530
Target: the hill at 8 o'clock!

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:39.220
Target hit.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:43.190
Only twenty percent of the energy was used.

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:46.300
It can only do this with twenty percent?

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:48.530
Forget it. I have no choice.

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:51.940
A warning to all Gallian soldiers!

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:54.860
Stop your futile resistance!

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:59.530
Your main force was annihilated in Ghirlandaio.

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:03.560
In front of our terrestrial dreadnought, the Marmota,

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:05.560
you stand no chance of winning!

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:07.210
What?!

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:09.500
Then Alicia really is...

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:13.690
I'm okay.

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:14.930
Sorry.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:17.930
Alicia really is...

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.590
I haven't apologized properly...

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:24.360
Idiot! Now's not the time to be grieving over such things!

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:26.390
There's nothing we can do.

00:08:26.390 --> 00:08:30.820
At the moment, we ourselves are in danger.

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:34.250
Don't make any more meaningless sacrifices.

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:35.980
Surrender immediately!

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:37.170
I repeat.

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:38.960
Surrender immediately!

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:39.790
Damn it.

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:41.520
This isn't funny.

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.640
How can it end like this?

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:47.080
That thing might have no weaknesses, though.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:48.870
Don't be stupid!

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:51.340
Are you just going to listen to them and surrender?

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:54.540
I didn't say that, did I?

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:56.050
I'll fight to my death.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.690
Don't lose faith, everyone.

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:05.270
They're just trying to lower our morale.

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:08.480
But there's nothing to lose faith over.

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.530
Alicia is alive!

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:12.140
If we don't believe that,

00:09:12.140 --> 00:09:14.750
then who would?

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:16.420
We can't give up!

00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:17.640
Not until the end!

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.180
Life or death...

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:38.760
Every one of us is walking on the boundary.{We're swaying on the fence}

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:42.810
Victory...

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:45.100
Failure...

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:46.600
Escape...

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:50.670
At this moment,

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:54.610
those words have lost their meaning.

00:09:57.980 --> 00:09:59.700
Survive.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.750
Continue to survive.

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:03.790
That's all we wish for,

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.620
and continue to pray for.

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:07.310
Alicia!

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:09.080
Survive!

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:14.730
At the moment, they have yet to surrender.

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:16.960
In fact, their resistance has increased.

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:18.730
What should we do?

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:20.630
What's the energy level of the holy spear? {OVER 9000!!!!! -Ky LOLZ}

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:21.360
Yes,

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:23.270
charging is complete.

00:10:23.270 --> 00:10:25.320
We can fire at any moment.

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:28.020
Time to gain the upper hand.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:30.270
It's a waste of time if we wait any longer.

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:32.520
Maximilian.

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.650
What is it, Jaeger?

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:38.000
Why do you thirst for power so much?

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:40.820
Selvaria died in the battle at Ghirlandaio.

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:46.560
At the same time, she also got rid of that Valkyria called Alicia and the main Gallian forces.

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:49.710
We've already conquered Gallia, haven't we?

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:54.260
However, you seem to have ulterior motives.

00:10:54.260 --> 00:10:56.850
Let me ask you first, Jaeger.

00:10:56.850 --> 00:11:02.560
Your hometown became a subject of the Empire because of Gregor.

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:07.450
But didn't you make use of me to climb to your current position?

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:10.230
Why are you hesitating now?

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:12.070
I'm not hesitating.

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:14.950
As you know,

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:18.070
for the sake of restoring independence to my home country Fhirald, I...

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:19.680
Maximilian,

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:21.610
I bet on your power.

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:25.970
I felt I could regain my country as long as I had military strength.

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:28.500
I thought only military strength could protect a country!

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:32.400
But now, Maximilian.

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:36.260
After invading Gallia, I'm at a loss.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:40.680
You, who wants power even though it means the sacrifice of your precious subordinates...

00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:45.060
And the Gallian militia, who love their hometowns and care for their companions...

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:48.370
What exactly do you need...

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:49.700
to protect something?

00:11:51.170 --> 00:11:52.870
How trivial.

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:54.320
What?

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:56.630
Power is everything.

00:11:56.630 --> 00:11:57.980
As long as we have power,

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:00.720
attacking is the same as protecting.

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:03.280
Am I wrong?

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:05.080
Then why?

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:10.290
So you didn't obtain the holy spear for the sake of conquering Gallia...

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:12.960
From the beginning, this was your goal.

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.480
You're right.

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:15.920
That's how it is.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.130
Why?!

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:20.560
Is it revenge?

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:41.000
That's certainly one reason.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:46.240
In order to bury that hateful past
together with my father and my brother to the grave.

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:49.990
I will surpass the emperor! {koutei no chi wo ryouga suru -Ky}

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:52.210
I will become the Valkyrian emperor!

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:57.540
As long as I have the power of the holy spear, that's within my reach.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.370
Don't you think so?

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:01.760
Maximilian...

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:04.670
Enough of this.

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:05.960
Prepare to fire!

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:06.890
Yes, sir!

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.860
Preparing to fire.

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:10.190
The target?

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:12.590
The target is Randgriz Castle.

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:27.560
Hey!

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:28.810
Look!

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:29.960
That bastard!

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:31.810
Does he plan to attack here now?

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:33.260
We need to evacuate!

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:35.100
If he's aiming for us,

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:37.390
it's already too late to run!

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:38.920
Don't give up until the very end!

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:46.430
Are you serious, Maximilian?

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:49.100
If you destroy everything with that power,

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:52.400
it'll be a repeat of the Darcsen Calamity! {Once again 'Darcsen Calamity' - Ryan}

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:54.020
So what?

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:56.510
Even if disaster comes,

00:13:56.510 --> 00:13:58.730
I'll bear it along with my destiny.

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:00.810
Energy charged!

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:02.190
Starting countdown!

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:22.050
There's an unknown entity in front of us!

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:24.050
What?

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:42.520
Alicia!

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.290
Did you say Alicia?

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:45.640
Are you serious?

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:47.370
Where's she?

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:48.660
It's true!

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:49.810
It's Alicia!

00:14:49.810 --> 00:14:51.820
She's alive!

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:52.930
Thank goodness!

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:56.270
Hey, Alicia!

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:57.420
Reporting.

00:14:57.420 --> 00:15:01.490
Right before we could shoot, the unknown entity's attack neutralized the energy!

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:08.340
Damn Valkyria!

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.290
Everyone, we're going to back up Alicia!

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:15.030
Let's go!

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:16.400
Yes, sir!

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:22.440
Alicia...

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:30.660
Alicia!

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.950
Everyone...

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:40.760
Alicia!

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:42.090
No!

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:44.370
They're coming closer!

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:46.220
Target still standing!

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:47.550
Continue shooting.

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:48.340
Yes, sir!

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.970
Just as I thought.

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:08.300
On top of being injured at Ghirlandaio,

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:12.740
you can't control your power very well yet.

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:16.780
I already know from observing Selvaria.

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:22.660
The holy spear has finished recharging.

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:49.360
Alicia!

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:52.240
I...

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:05.050
I will survive!

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:08.250
For the sake of...

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:10.310
protecting my loved ones! {Protecting the one I love?}{It should be plural -owq}

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:13.300
This is the end.

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:42.900
Due to the attack just now, the fourth gun platform was damaged.

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:45.170
Begin repairs immediately.

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:49.220
Also, capture the Valkyria at once.

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:50.630
Hey.

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:52.700
What do you plan to do with her?

00:17:56.800 --> 00:18:01.170
Obtaining more power will only be more dangerous.

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:02.260
And...

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:06.530
Do you want a repeat of the tragedy with Selvaria?

00:18:06.530 --> 00:18:08.200
I thought I told you.

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:10.700
If you get in my way,

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.750
I won't be lenient. Even with you.

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:15.310
I see.

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:18.980
But I don't agree with your ways anymore.

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:21.490
I'm going to take a different path.

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:24.540
Is that so?

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:27.180
What a shame, Jaeger.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.180
Alicia!

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:53.940
Damn!

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:56.100
You're too reckless, Commander!

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:58.570
I'm going to save Alicia.

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:01.310
Tell everyone to escape.

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:04.900
You think they'll listen to an order like that?

00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:07.080
Commander!

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.930
We're going too!

00:19:08.930 --> 00:19:12.250
I told you not to sneak away, didn't I?

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.460
Everyone...

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:27.390
Sorry for being late, Welkin!

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:30.020
I'll cover you guys!

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:31.250
Faldio!

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:36.690
Squad 7!

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:39.030
We're going to save Alicia!

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:40.030
Let's go!

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:42.320
Follow me!

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:47.660
Don't let them get close! Fire!

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:08.260
Wait for us,

00:20:08.260 --> 00:20:09.520
Alicia!

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:13.570
Largo, Rosie, Zaka.

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:17.160
Jann, Susie, Edy, Homer.

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:19.790
Oscar, Emile, Karlos{not sure, Karl in the game}.

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:23.220
Marina, Aisha, Hans.

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:24.120
Isara...

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:26.300
And Alicia...

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:29.240
Everyone's my precious companion.

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:31.710
Next time on Valkyria Chronicles,

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:34.220
The final episode: Final Battle.

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:37.300
